<title>Set-up SyncTeX</title>
<p>
The following packages need to be installed in order to add support for SyncTeX:
</p>
<list>
  <item>
    <p>
      A LaTeX engine with SyncTeX support, such as <app>pdflatex</app>.
    </p>
  </item>
  <item>
    <p>
      A text editor with SyncTeX support, such as <app>pluma</app> with pluma-plugins installed.
    </p>
  </item>
</list>

<p>
  In <app>pluma</app>, enable the SyncTeX Plugin:
</p>
<steps>
   <item>
    <p>
     Click <guiseq><gui>Edit</gui><gui>Preferences</gui><gui>Plugins</gui></guiseq> tab.
    </p>
   </item>
   <item>
    <p>
     Check <gui>SyncTeX</gui>.
    </p>
   </item>
</steps>
</page>
